        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sinter, iron, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sinter, iron, at plant
Inputs and air emissions from different sources. Transports of iron ore calculated according to information about exports and imports.;
UUID: cce8cc46-af1b-39f8-b5e4-584fbc8c0714
Blending, mixing and sintering. Emissions are abated
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Down draft sintering on continuous travelling grates
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 3.83E11 kg/a
Sampling: Main in- and outputs based on world average, emissions based on some plants in the EU. Everything based on literature. 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cce8cc46-af1b-39f8-b5e4-584fbc8c0714.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
